bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Profile Page" as UI
boundary Router
control "DonationController" as Controller
entity "DonationService" as Service
entity "DonationModel" as DonationModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI : 1. Open Profile page
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router : 2. GET /api/donation/sent
activate Router
Router -> Controller : 3. getSentGifts(req)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service : 4. getSentGifts(userId)
activate Service
Service -> DonationModel : 5. find({ senderId })\npopulate(receiver, item)\nsort()
activate DonationModel

DonationModel -> MongoDB : 6. Execute query
activate MongoDB

MongoDB --> DonationModel : 7. documents
deactivate MongoDB

DonationModel --> Service : 8. donations
deactivate DonationModel

Service --> Controller : 9. result
deactivate Service
Controller --> Router : 10. HTTP response 
deactivate Controller
Router --> UI : 11. donation history list
deactivate Router
UI -> User : 12. Display donation history list
deactivate UI
deactivate User